Z||000005||artherd||12-20-2001||02:07 AM||||Hey! I like wine!<P>I'm offended!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000006||LZeitgeist||12-20-2001||07:11 AM||||This is the first I'm seeing of this, but if I know Formula88, the reason he brought it back to the Forum is because if we have an a$$hole among us, everybody deserves to know so they don't become the next 'target'.<P>"Your friend seems to be a nice guy." Yeah, I (his friend) *am* a nice guy. SO IS HE. And undeserving of some bull$hit like that.<P>And as was said in the other thread, the clutch hydraulics were working fine before we swapped clutches. We *knew* the clutch was shot to hell - we just didn't know why. Turned out the axle seal was bad and fluid worked its way past the flywheel dust cover to get on the mating surfaces. It won't be able to do that again. "And talk about assinine, dropping the cradle to change the flywheel before bleeding the clutch, how cool is that?" F*ck you, L67Formula, and your 'help', too. A$$hole.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Formula88||12-20-2001||09:33 AM||||Actually, brought it to the forum for one reason.  I don't attack or send people inflamitory email.  If I have something to say, I'll say it right here, in public, in front of everyone.  <P>Also, like LZ said, if he responds to me this way, he'll likely do it to someone else.  Just an FYI.  I will not discuss the content of the email.  I posted it for everyone's edification.  Take from it what you will.  Likewise, in order to avoid a flame war on this thread, I will not reply to this thread again.<P>If Cliff wishes to close or delete this thread, by all means do so.||||reg||1
